  "content_id": "16136227",
  "title": "Firo Network Fees",
  "description": "Firo (FIRO) Network – Private and Accessible\nFiro (formerly Zcoin) focuses on financial privacy through Lelantus technology and efficient ...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ32G55BK7RW0QE6Q1B5JJ2\">Firo (FIRO) Network – Private and Accessible</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Firo (formerly Zcoin) focuses on financial privacy through Lelantus technology and efficient transactions.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ32G551B49GYQYSSRZVH3Y\">How Firo Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are based on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Privacy features used</b><br>Paid in <b>FIRO</b> tokens.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge estimates fees automatically depending on whether you’re sending private or regular transactions.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ32G5519GCVMX9T1T4ZW02\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – For faster confirmations</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced approach</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Save on fees, slower confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Advanced manual settings</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ32G55HA56NJ68MKWRPMP8\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.01 to $0.10 USD</b> per transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ32G55DEMSV2JQ5VNH72ZX\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Firo balances privacy and cost effectively. Edge Wallet helps you choose your fee simply while protecting your anonymity.</p>",
